Release transformations: six selected original phone archives are unmodified;
reference numeric values are reformatted into CSV; local processing paths are
removed from exported header metadata; new candidate acceleration catalogs,
epoch indexes, example clips, documentation and helper scripts are added.
The paper text and third-party reference-processing software are not distributed.
